  "name": "Cold Shrimp Salad",
  "subtitle": "A bright, chilled seafood salad with peppers and avocado",
  "description": "Cooked shrimp, crisp peppers, onion, cilantro, and avocado are tossed with olive oil and seasonings, then chilled before serving.",
